## ObjectType: Recorded Inventory

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| snapshot_id | Snapshot id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | snapshot_id |
| product_id | Product id | string | Foreign key to products; blank creates no edge. | product_id |
| lot_id | Lot id | string | Foreign key to lots; blank creates no edge. | lot_id |
| location_id | Location id | string | Foreign key to locations; blank creates no edge. | location_id |
| as_of_date | As of date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | as_of_date |
| knowledge_date | Knowledge date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | knowledge_date |
| unit | Unit | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: ea. | unit |
| on_hand | On hand | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | on_hand |
| in_transit | In transit | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | in_transit |
| quarantined | Quarantined | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | quarantined |
| reserved | Reserved | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | reserved |
| available | Available | decimal | Recorded dated snapshot, not live reconstruction; unknown remains null. | available |

### Keys

Primary Keys: snapshot_id
Display Key: snapshot_id
